 "brief": "The Palestine Center for Prisoners' Studies documented 530 arrests across the occupied West Bank and East Jerusalem during September, including 39 minors and 15 women and girls, Shehab Wire reported. The center said Israeli occupation authorities maintained a policy of raids and detention operations throughout the month. One Palestinian died in custody during the period, the center added.\n\nThe 530 arrests were accompanied by 625 administrative detention orders—imprisonment without charge or trial—according to the Palestine Center for Prisoners' Studies.",
